Package: mica-apid
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: micad (= 0.1.0-3), mica-system, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS HTTPS API and web dashboard
 Serves the management API and the built-in web UI over HTTPS and changes the
 device only through micad. Starts at boot.
